fixes #66209 
Now it is possible for extensions to contribute label formatting rules. Here's how such a contribution would look like inside a `package.json` for example.

```json
"contributes": {
		"resourceLabelFormatters": [
			{
				  "scheme": "vscode",
                                  "authority": "wsl*",
                                  "formatting": {
				      "label": "${path}",
				      "separator": "/",
				      "tildify": true,
				      "workspaceSuffix": "WSL"
                                 }
			} 
		]
}
```

